\b Molovox Labs installation terms\b0\par
\par
Setup installs Molovox Labs for this computer and adds a Start menu shortcut. It requires administrator approval. Your sounds and settings stay in %APPDATA%\\QuietLab and are kept on uninstall.\par
\par
By checking the acceptance box and selecting Install, you agree to these setup terms and authorize setup to download and install the dependencies listed below. Setup installs missing dependencies before Molovox Labs. Downloads require an internet connection. You may need to restart Windows after installing VB-CABLE. Each dependency has its own terms, available at the addresses below.\par
\par
FFmpeg (Gyan Windows build): https://www.gyan.dev/ffmpeg/builds/\par
FFmpeg licensing: https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html\par
Microsoft Edge WebView2: https://developer.microsoft.com/microsoft-edge/webview2/\par
VB-CABLE: https://www.vb-cable.com/\par
\par
VB-CABLE is donationware from VB-Audio. Contributions are welcome. The prerequisites remain available for reuse if you remove Molovox Labs.\par
